{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4beQLfRL8LyuP9XieH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, scarred by time.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*But which key? And which lock?*\n\n*I am every door and no door. I am the concept of threshold itself.*\n\n*My lock awaits a name.*\n\n*Speak the door, and I shall become it. Speak the key, and I shall test it.*\n\n*But \"key\" alone opens nothing. A key without a lock is just a piece of metal. A door without a name is just a wall pretending.*\n\n**I remain shut.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":132,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}